WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.372
This is not an expedition

00:00:13.054 --> 00:00:14.856
It's an execution

00:00:16.464 --> 00:00:20.781
When they put you in here... they don't want you to return

00:00:22.096 --> 00:00:26.273
And even if you do, and even if they keep their promises...

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:29.490
What freedom waits for you?

00:00:30.312 --> 00:00:34.737
A few dying ships in a sea of dead stars

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:40.323
If there is still hope... it lies beyond the veil

00:00:40.827 --> 00:00:46.290
Hope in this void is as illusionary as that starlight

00:00:47.132 --> 00:00:51.606
I will choose to breath my last... here

00:00:51.957 --> 00:00:54.749
At the bottom of an ocean

00:00:56.215 --> 00:00:57.324
Unseen

00:00:58.953 --> 00:01:00.000
Unheard

00:01:02.194 --> 00:01:03.798
Uncontrolled

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:08.320
They will get their execution

00:01:16.899 --> 00:01:19.196
I will get my freedom

